# Example snippet

This file is an example. Its name does not end in `.md`, so the composer does not
load it. Copy it to a `.md` name to activate your own content.

## House rules

- Keep replies short.
- Use metric units.

## Custom MCP server

The `weather` server in `joshua.yaml` returns a forecast. Call `get_forecast`
with a city name when a person asks about the weather.
